  "description": "A Blender scene containing Backrooms components to create unlimited Backrooms designs/environments. Contains scalable walls, carpet and ceiling components. Textures were created in Blender and converted to jpgs\n\nWalls (white brick & Backrooms wallpapered) Should be edited in EDIT mode with ‘Correct Face Attributes’ selected in the options menu to maintain the correct texture scale. (see video)\n\nThe floor (carpet, two types) should be scaled in edit mode to maintain the correct texture scale. (see video)\n\nKit includes: \nScaleable walls (which can be scaled to create pillars/columns) \nScaleable carpet (two types) \nAir conditioner vents. \nCeiling lights (emission shaders - for Cycles renders) \nCeiling tile (use array modifier to create whole ceilings) \nCeiling tile with AC vent\n\nYoutube video demo.\nhttps://youtu.be/CFNtyszl-_U\n\nand a Youtube video created using the kit to create a Backrooms VHS clip:\n\nhttps://youtu.be/-p123qNeVD8",
